{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horror Night with TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your car broke down. Middle of the forest. No signal. You spot a creepy mansion up the hill. You knock. No answer. Just as you turn to leave\u2014CREAK\u2014the door opens by itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>- You step in.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>- Bad idea.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you\u2019re trapped. No windows open. No doors unlock. But something is inside. And it\u2019s not happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the shadows, you hear it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>- \u201cTUNG. TUNG. TUNG. SAHUR.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He\u2019s coming. He\u2019s got games. And you\u2019re the main player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong>, a drum-beating nightmare with a twisted sense of fun. He doesn't want to kill you right away\u2014he wants to play. If you want to survive, you\u2019ll need to solve every cursed puzzle, dodge every jumpscare, and outsmart his chaotic friends, including the one and only Tralalero Tralala, who might be your only hope\u2026 if he stops spinning in circles for five seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>FEATURES:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Explore a Haunted Mansion full of traps, cursed hallways, and too many basements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Solve Deadly Puzzles before the next round of TUNG TUNG begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Snap Creepy Photos to reveal secrets (and maybe unlock a screaming ghost or two).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Use a Pistol to slow Tung Tung down when he gets too close for comfort.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Survive Brainrot Mayhem featuring a cast of cursed icons like Brr Brr Patapim, Ghoulberto Spaghatini, and the flying menace known only as Auntie Boom Boom.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one rule in this mansion: Play the game, or the game plays you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And remember\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUNG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUNG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUNG. SAHUR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You knocked. Now you\u2019re stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Good luck.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733650?t=1751673246","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733650?t=1751673246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733650/8643e85d23ab7cfcb330aa0c0567af5b82546de2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751673246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733650/8643e85d23ab7cfcb330aa0c0567af5b82546de2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751673246","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game may cause anxiety and fear, and Jump Scares often appear in the game with scary sound. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horror Night with TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your car broke down. Middle of the forest. No signal. You spot a creepy mansion up the hill. You knock. No answer. Just as you turn to leave\u2014CREAK\u2014the door opens by itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>- You step in.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>- Bad idea.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you\u2019re trapped. No windows open. No doors unlock. But something is inside. And it\u2019s not happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the shadows, you hear it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>- \u201cTUNG. TUNG. TUNG. SAHUR.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He\u2019s coming. He\u2019s got games. And you\u2019re the main player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong>, a drum-beating nightmare with a twisted sense of fun. He doesn't want to kill you right away\u2014he wants to play. If you want to survive, you\u2019ll need to solve every cursed puzzle, dodge every jumpscare, and outsmart his chaotic friends, including the one and only Tralalero Tralala, who might be your only hope\u2026 if he stops spinning in circles for five seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>FEATURES:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Explore a Haunted Mansion full of traps, cursed hallways, and too many basements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Solve Deadly Puzzles before the next round of TUNG TUNG begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Snap Creepy Photos to reveal secrets (and maybe unlock a screaming ghost or two).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Use a Pistol to slow Tung Tung down when he gets too close for comfort.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Survive Brainrot Mayhem featuring a cast of cursed icons like Brr Brr Patapim, Ghoulberto Spaghatini, and the flying menace known only as Auntie Boom Boom.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one rule in this mansion: Play the game, or the game plays you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And remember\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUNG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUNG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUNG. SAHUR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You knocked. Now you\u2019re stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Good luck.</strong></p>","developers":["Source Byte"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733650/c8c680a2d4c92f42d7216eda350238e356c6ddc5/header.jpg?t=1751673246","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Horror Night with Tung Tung Tung Sahur","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 10/11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Source Byte"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"30 Jul, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"p